      "name": "Sticky Note Tail",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "02_Document_Pipeline — Drive -> extract -> chunk -> (NEW) dedup + embed + upsert\n\nAPPENDED TAIL (mirrors 03_YouTube_Pipeline):\nChunk -> Config -> Has Text? -> Hash Content -> Hash UID\n  -> Check Existing Hashes -> Filter New Chunks -> Embed Chunk (Gemini 1536)\n  -> Build Upsert Row -> Upsert Chunk (Supabase knowledge_chunks)\n\nDOCUMENT vs YOUTUBE mapping:\n- video_id = document_id (same value in both fields)\n- source_url = https://drive.google.com/file/d/<document_id>/view\n- start_time = null, timestamp_url = '' (documents have no timestamps)\n- No status sheet: just dedup + embed + upsert.\n\nSHARED TABLE: knowledge_chunks (same as 03). chunk_uid UNIQUE is the upsert\nconflict target. Embedding dim MUST be 1536 to match the column.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460
      },
      "position": [
        896,
        2272
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
